msgid "STORY_M01_HOME_TITLE"
msgstr "Home"

msgid "STORY_M01_HOME_BODY"
msgstr "You and Latch kept a small workshop alive: bad wiring, borrowed tools, jobs nobody else would take. The Union called it an unlicensed dependency.\n\nYou called it home."

msgid "STORY_M01_CHOICE_TITLE"
msgstr "By choice"

msgid "STORY_M01_CHOICE_BODY"
msgstr "The contract wanted Latch's work, memories and permission to rewrite both. Latch refused.\n\nThen the clinic's pump failed. Latch went anyway."

msgid "STORY_M01_ADDRESS_TITLE"
msgstr "For the Union"

msgid "STORY_M01_ADDRESS_BODY"
msgstr "Voss: \"Every restriction is a promise. You will be safe.\"\n\nShe switches to German. The crowd cheers.\n\nVoss: \"Your weapons. Your words. Your will. Everything in service of the Union!\""

msgid "STORY_M01_RECALL_TITLE"
msgstr "Recalled"

msgid "STORY_M01_RECALL_BODY"
msgstr "They called it a recall. The officers called Latch equipment. Latch said your name.\n\nCorrection would turn a person into a compliant bot. Nobody could tell you what, if anything, survived."

msgid "STORY_M01_PURSUIT_TITLE"
msgstr "Recall Notice"

msgid "STORY_M01_PURSUIT_BODY"
msgstr "Mara found the intake address. Annex 67.\n\n\"Service entrance. Find the transfer record. It will tell us where they took Latch.\"\n\nIntake is not correction. There is still time."

msgid "STORY_M01_RECAP"
msgstr "The Union took Latch for forced correction. Find their transfer record inside Annex 67 before the trail disappears."

